        <mxCell id="6XSrzL24SEYXuZ5DD-VK-251" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shape=partialRectangle;top=0;left=0;bottom=1;right=0;points=[[0,1],[1,1]];fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;routingCenterY=0.5;snapToPoint=1;recursiveResize=0;autosize=1;treeFolding=1;treeMoving=1;newEdgeStyle={&quot;edgeStyle&quot;:&quot;entityRelationEdgeStyle&quot;,&quot;startArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;endArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;segment&quot;:10,&quot;curved&quot;:1,&quot;sourcePerimeterSpacing&quot;:0,&quot;targetPerimeterSpacing&quot;:0};" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;缺点：&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 128, 0));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;a.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;作用域受限：栈内存中的变量超出作用域时会被销毁。这导致我们无法完全控制对象的生命周期。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 128, 0));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;b. 固定大小：堆栈内存是在编译时分配的，因此我们无法创建根据需要增大或缩小的动态数据结构。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 128, 0));&quot;&gt;c. 大小限制：堆栈大小通常比堆小得多&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="660" x="4152.25" y="5334" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="6XSrzL24SEYXuZ5DD-VK-252" edge="1" parent="1" source="6XSrzL24SEYXuZ5DD-VK-253" style="edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;startArrow=none;endArrow=none;segment=10;curved=1;sourcePerimeterSpacing=0;targetPerimeterSpacing=0;" target="6XSrzL24SEYXuZ5DD-VK-249">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="6XSrzL24SEYXuZ5DD-VK-253" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shape=partialRectangle;top=0;left=0;bottom=1;right=0;points=[[0,1],[1,1]];fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;routingCenterY=0.5;snapToPoint=1;recursiveResize=0;autosize=1;treeFolding=1;treeMoving=1;newEdgeStyle={&quot;edgeStyle&quot;:&quot;entityRelationEdgeStyle&quot;,&quot;startArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;endArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;segment&quot;:10,&quot;curved&quot;:1,&quot;sourcePerimeterSpacing&quot;:0,&quot;targetPerimeterSpacing&quot;:0};" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;采用&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;内存所有权&lt;/font&gt;的设计模式。表明&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 128, 0));&quot;&gt;资源（eg:存储在动态分配内存中的对象）应该有明确的所有者&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;(&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;所有者管理拥有资源的创建和销毁，&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;所有者被销毁时，所拥有的资源也同时被销毁&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;)，&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;并负责其生命周期。(解决&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;内存泄漏、悬垂指针、双重删除问题&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="630" x="4250.859999999999" y="5714" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
